  {
   "instrument_id": "EO:11285",
   "outcome": "blocked",
   "reason": "[\"The held span for this order includes unrelated Federal Register pages (the dossier reports order_boundary_clause_conflict with 45 scopes, many from a Department of Commerce rules page), so the inventory needs correction by offsets; and the designations continue until the interest equalization tax provisions ended, for which no statute text is held. Missing sources: the statute or order that ended the tax (the dossier lists Public Law 94-455 as absent from the census) and a clean order boundary.\"]"
  },
  {
   "instrument_id": "EO:11309",
   "outcome": "blocked",
   "reason": "[\"The order amends section 4(a) of EO 11215 by changing 18 months to 20 months. Under the strike-and-insert ruling the amended clause continues until EO 11215 ends, and no held source gives the transmittal date of the Commission final report that ends EO 11215 under its own section 4(b); whether the amending order is itself spent on taking effect or continues as part of EO 11215 is also unresolved for a deadline amendment. Missing source: the final report transmittal date or an order terminating the Commission on the Patent System.\"]"
  },
